{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2021-05-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN TO PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN 37TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., MAY 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN 37TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 2. KATHY WARDEN, CHAIRMAN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, AND DAVE KEFFER, CORPORATE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PRESENT BEGINNING AT 9:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THE PRESENTATION WILL BE WEBCAST LIVE AT HTTP://INVESTOR.NORTHROPGRUMMAN.COM .'}